  "components": [
    {
      "type": "e_vehicle_battery",
      "description": "The Priority 500-watt motor is powered by a 576 watt-hour battery that's integrated into the rear rack, keeping the lines of The e-Coast super clean. The battery is easily removable and can be charged on or off the bike. The integrated rack is perfect for loading up all your essentials for a day at the beach, or wherever you plan to set sail. eBike battery UL 2271 certified by SGS. Please review NYC Lithium-Ion Battery Safety information."
    },
    {
      "type": "e_vehicle_motor",
      "description": "The e-Coast is outfitted with a dual-control Priority 500-watt rear hub motor. The variable pedal assist cadence sensor AND twist throttle offers flexibility around how you engage the motor. It ships as a Class 2, 20 mph setting, but can increase to a Class 3, 28 mph setting (please note local laws). Five different pedal assist modes are available. eBike system UL 2849 certified by Underwriters Laboratories."
    }
